00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.180
The target, a Russian base

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:50.183
a mile away beneath two white towers.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.585
Easy for the drone to see.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.454
Becoming an easy a shot

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.489
for the gun to leap.

00:00:56.823 --> 00:00:58.591
We learned how to fire this ancient

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.827
cast-Iron gun from hidden positions.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:04.197
Callsign Al says they broadcast the video

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.398
on our tablet

00:01:05.398 --> 00:01:07.233
and we can see where we hit.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.702
It allows us to aim very fast

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.371
and precisely

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:13.106
it's real shoot and scoot stuff.

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.240
They've been on the position

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:15.308
