00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:23.383
A smaller gun.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.318
More improvization.

00:01:25.318 --> 00:01:27.620
More shoot and scoot.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:30.390
For much of Ukraine's long front lines,

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.591
hits and run

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.226
